WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.745
When your buyers ask AI who to hire, does
your name come up?

2
00:00:03.895 --> 00:00:06.606
Right now, it's probably recommending
someone else.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.080
We make your brand the answer.

4
00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:14.135
Four engines working together, in one
brand voice, with one report.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.730
First, we track the questions your buyers
actually ask.

6
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.529
Then we find out why AI points to someone
else.

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.894
Next, we turn what your experts know into
content in your voice.

8
00:00:29.044 --> 00:00:31.649
Nothing goes out until an editor signs
off.

9
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.286
We test new ads every week and keep what
works.

10
00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:41.999
Each outbound email is researched first,
and nothing sends without your approval.

11
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.959
Every month, you'll see what moved and
what didn't.

12
00:00:46.109 --> 00:00:50.397
No one can promise citations, so we show
you the work and the next fix.

13
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.564
Your team stays in charge of strategy and
approvals.

14
00:00:54.714 --> 00:00:57.984
The first pieces usually go out in weeks
three to five.

15
00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.855
Want to see where you stand?

16
00:01:00.005 --> 00:01:00.841
Book a call.

